# Eats Drinks Drums and Good Vibes

**_Slap this one in your diaries....last Saturday of the month!!_** _Community Event Saturday May 30th @ [Renae's Pantry](https://www.facebook.com/RenaesPantry), The Lane. 4-6 Main St Palmwoods 2pm_ _Free community event for everyone!_ After many requests and lots of interest we will be starting a once a month "Eats, Drinks, Drums and Good Vibes" event on the last Saturday of every month in collaboration with [Renae's Pantry](https://www.facebook.com/RenaesPantry). This is a free community event where everyone can bring their own drum or grab one of ours and join us in a relaxed afternoon of musical jammin'. All instruments are welcome and of course Rhythm Culture students and dancers will be there doing their 'thang'! There will be food, cake, chai and good vibes available for all! [![eats drinks drums ](/media/2015/05/LAST-SATURDAY-DRUM-1.jpg)](/media/2015/05/LAST-SATURDAY-DRUM-1.jpg)
